EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY archive

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

LINK_NAME Sample Config File
LINK archive.d.txt

#LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
#LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>archive</b> saves the contents of one or more DB Events to 
SAC directory(s).  <b>archive</b> then deletes the data for each Event 
from the DB.  
<br><br>
Events are selected by specifying a range of DB idEvents as a set of command 
line parameters to the program.
<br><br>
By using command line parameters, the user can also tweak the actions of <b>archive</b>,
so that it does not save data to a SAC directory, or so it does not delete any
or part of the Event data from the DB.
<br>

Initial version: lucky 02/15/00


